    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31628" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκᾰτόμ-βαιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, epith. of Apollo and Zeus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to whom hecatombs were offered,</i>
			<i><span class="en">Hsch.,
				<u>EM</u>321.7</span></i>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήν</span>) name of a month,
				<u>Hemerolog.Flor.</u>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκατόμβαια, τά,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκατόμβοια</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				1715
			</span></i> (Delph.).</div>
